    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "resilience sounds like a euphemism for just prolonging the agony. if the path is set, then all we're doing is choosing to experience as much trauma and loss as possible before it's over. i just don't see the logic in clinging to a sinking ship. it feels like there should be a more dignified way to face it than just sitting here waiting for the impact. wouldn't it make more sense to just... not have to see it happen?",
